---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InteriorHero from '../../components/shared/InteriorHero.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/home/FinalCTA.astro';

const locale = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale={locale}
  title="Privacy Policy - Kultivate"
  description="Privacy notice for the current staging website and its planned contact form."
>
  <InteriorHero
    label="PRIVACY"
    variant="legal-compact"
    title="Privacy without the puzzle"
    description="What is active now, what is still planned, and how personal data is kept out of an unconfirmed workflow."
    image="/assets/why/visible-decisions.webp"
    imageAlt="Transparent planes moving into exact alignment"
    compact
  />

  <section
    class="section privacy-content-section flow-section"
    data-scroll-key="privacy-content"
  >
    <div class="container">
      <div class="privacy-card card">
        <h2>1. Current staging status</h2>
        <p>
          The contact form on this staging website is a non-submitting preview. Its submit control is disabled, so the website does not send the displayed form fields to a form processor.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Planned form fields and purpose</h2>
        <p>
          If the form is activated after its endpoint and public contact details are confirmed, the planned fields are name, company, email, WhatsApp number, service interest, project summary, target timeline, and budget range. They would be used to review an inquiry, prepare a scope, and communicate about the requested work.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Processing status</h2>
        <p>
          No public form processor is active in the current staging experience. The processor, retention approach, and relevant privacy terms must be confirmed and documented before submission is enabled.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Privacy requests</h2>
        <p>
          The public privacy contact is still being finalized. Please do not enter personal information into the preview form. Contact instructions for questions, corrections, or deletion requests will be published after confirmation.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Analytics and cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website currently does not use analytics or tracking cookies. If that changes, this notice and any required consent controls must be updated before tracking is enabled.
        </p>

        <p class="last-updated text-mono">Staging status reviewed: August 20, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FinalCTA locale={locale} />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-content-section {
    padding-block: clamp(72px, 9vw, 118px);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7, 11, 18, 0.32), rgba(5, 8, 14, 0.5));
  }

  .privacy-card {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .privacy-card h2 {
    margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-sm);
    color: var(--signal-ice);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .privacy-card h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }

  .privacy-card p {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    color: var(--mist);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .last-updated {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--slate);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    color: var(--steel);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
</style>
